  "description": "Details pursuant to condition 12 (materials) of Variation of Conditions reference 20/1561 dated 27 August, 2020, for Minor material amendment application for the variation of conditions 2 (proposed drawings and documents), 3 (ground floor plan), 8 (construction method statement), 10 (arboricultural), 11 (arboricultural protection measures), 13 (ecology), 15 (drainage strategy) and 17 (Number and type of units, condition inserted through permission 20/1003) and removal of condition 6 (sound insulation measures) of full planning consent 16/3294 as varied by non-material amendment application 20/1003.The proposed variation includes the removal of the western wing of the consented building, internal and external amendments to the building, the reduction of the number of homes from 17 to 13 and other changes including an increase and amendment to soft landscaping and changes to the proposed parking layout.Planning consent 16/3294 as varied by 20/1003 was for the redevelopment of Clock Cottage and its grounds to include the retention and reuse of Clock Cottage, demolition of the single storey stable buildings and erection of a two storey building to provide self-contained units to be used as assisted living accommodation for adults with disabilities with associated staff areas, car and cycle parking spaces, bin stores, amenity space and landscaping",
